{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B.I.D. - Boss in Diapers is a fun multiplayer card game. 2-4 players fight to decide who rules the daycare. The goal is simple: Outsmart your friends and claim the Boss Chair!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers a unique take on classic card games with a baby-mafia twist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.I.D.</strong>: The main mode. Use strategy, make offers, and bluff to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baby Bluff:</strong> A fast and risky battle. Lying is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More chaos is coming soon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Create Your Baby Mafia Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your little mafia boss with tiny suits, pacifiers, fedoras, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your high chair with accessories and toys!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>The Teacher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match happens in a colorful classroom. It looks innocent, but chaos is coming. Don't make the Teacher mad! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with 2-4 players. Trick your rivals, laugh together, and claim the Boss Chair!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124640?t=1767170304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124640?t=1767170304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/681c8eccedda6662cdfdc5dc423682009a1abdc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767170304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/681c8eccedda6662cdfdc5dc423682009a1abdc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767170304","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B.I.D. - Boss in Diapers is a fun multiplayer card game. 2-4 players fight to decide who rules the daycare. The goal is simple: Outsmart your friends and claim the Boss Chair!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers a unique take on classic card games with a baby-mafia twist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.I.D.</strong>: The main mode. Use strategy, make offers, and bluff to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baby Bluff:</strong> A fast and risky battle. Lying is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More chaos is coming soon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Create Your Baby Mafia Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your little mafia boss with tiny suits, pacifiers, fedoras, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your high chair with accessories and toys!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>The Teacher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match happens in a colorful classroom. It looks innocent, but chaos is coming. Don't make the Teacher mad! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with 2-4 players. Trick your rivals, laugh together, and claim the Boss Chair!</p>","developers":["HOGO Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/752fcce92d7d8e83638d94594eb982f1d41d101a/header.jpg?t=1767170304","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u